Package: abpool
Title: Approximate Bayesian Pooling for Multiple Imputation
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Daniel", "Phillips", , "daniel.phillips@paediatrics.ox.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements approximate Bayesian pooling (ABpool) for statistical inference after multiple imputation. Provides functions to generate approximate posterior samples, calculate credible intervals, and assess the adequacy of Rubin's rules.
Imports:
    mice,
    mvtnorm
